{
  "id": "DOC-17-Te7f2b",
  "title": "Text: DET Ben Fidelman ↔ Anthony Fenech",
  "date": "2017-12-11",
  "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
  "to": "Anthony Fenech",
  "type": "text",
  "subjects": [],
  "content": [
    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "12:00 AM",
      "text": "I’m kind of pissed we didn’t do one for just Tigers TV, but whatever"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:01 AM",
      "text": "I mean, what more enlightening quotes would he give solidarity"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:02 AM",
      "text": "Solidarily*, but apparently that’s not a word"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "12:03 AM",
      "text": "It’s not as much about the solid nature of the quotes as it is about the exclusive access"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:05 AM",
      "text": "Yeah I get it"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:39 AM",
      "text": "I like the high standards for retiring numbers"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "10:39 AM",
      "text": "I do not"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:03 PM",
      "text": "You hearing anything?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "4:04 PM",
      "text": "All is quiet far as I know"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:05 PM",
      "text": "Ok thanks"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "6:30 PM",
      "text": "https://twitter.com/anthonyfenech/status/940358829329481729"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "6:30 PM",
      "text": "Pretty cruel to put this on twitter as a literal statement"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:30 PM",
      "text": "Huh"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:31 PM",
      "text": "Are you really going Justin Verlander on me?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "6:31 PM",
      "text": "Makes it seem like Gardy was undercutting Al, you know that’s not the context in which it was said"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:31 PM",
      "text": "GTFO"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "6:31 PM",
      "text": "It was like a joking addition rather than a statement"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:32 PM",
      "text": "No shit, everyone gets that"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:32 PM",
      "text": "Well maybe not everyone. There are plenty of stupid people out there"
    }
  ]
}